      "section_path": [
        "Manager FAQ",
        "What should I approve first?"
      ],
      "text": "Start with the oldest pending request in Team > Approvals. Decide within two business days. Reminders arrive after one business day; HR escalation follows after three. Support ticket SLAs are separate.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
