      "section_path": [
        "Manager FAQ",
        "Can I edit attendance directly?"
      ],
      "text": "In v2.0, decide the employee's correction request. Direct manager edits belong to v1.8. Locked records go to HR Payroll; do not remove a lock to clear the queue. Approved corrections recalculate within five minutes.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
