      "section_path": [
        "Manager FAQ",
        "Does colleague acceptance finalize a swap?"
      ],
      "text": "No. Check both assignments for skills, weekly hours and 11 consecutive hours of rest, then approve or reject. Until approval updates both assignments together, the original roster applies.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
