      "section_path": [
        "Manager FAQ",
        "Can a delegate approve everything?"
      ],
      "text": "A delegate acts only for the configured team and dates, without access to medical attachments or payslips. Self-approval is blocked and routed to an alternative approver. If APPROVAL-409 appears, reload: another decision has already been saved.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
